WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
KARIM R. LAKHANI: Open
innovation is a paradigm

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:07.580
that says that ideas,
solutions, and people

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.630
to some of the most difficult
problems faced by organizations

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.870
actually reside outside
of the organization,

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.720
and the key for people
inside the organization

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.710
is to figure out how to access
these people, these ideas,

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.510
and these solutions.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:30.410
The world is full of amazing people
that are scattered around the globe,

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.970
and open innovation allows you
to systematically get access

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.140
to these people and help your
company and your organization

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.490
solve their most difficult challenges.

